  "officialText" : "Subject to the limitations of Sections 1607.11.1.1 through 1607.11.1.4 and Table 1607.1, members for which a value of KLLAT is 400 square feet (37.16 m 2 ) or more are permitted to be designed for a reduced uniformly distributed live load, L, in accordance with the following equation:\n\n(Equation 16-30)\n\nwhere:\n\nwhere: L = Reduced design live load per square foot (m2) of area supported by the member.\n\nLo = Unreduced design live load per square foot (m2) of area supported by the member (see Table 1607.1).\n\nKLL = Live load element factor (see Table 1607.11.1).\n\nAT = Tributary area, in square feet (m 2 ).\n\nL shall not be less than 0.50Lo for members supporting one floor and L shall not be less than 0.40Lo for members supporting two or more floors.\n\nTable 1607.11.1 Live Load Element Factor KLL",
